{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05348","headline":"贬降至汝州广城驿 · 郑愔","name":"贬降至汝州广城驿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"近郊凭汝海，遐服指江干。\n尚忆趋朝贵，方知失路难。\n曙宫平乐远，秋泽广城寒。\n岸苇新花白，山梨晚叶丹。\n乡关千里暮，岁序四时阑。\n函塞云间别，旋门雾里看。\n夙年追騄骥，暮节仰鵷鸾。\n疲驽劳垂耳，骞腾讵矫翰。\n将调梅铉实，不正李园冠。\n荆玉终无玷，随珠忽已弹。\n晓装违巩洛，夕梦在长安。\n北上频伤阮，西征未学潘。\n倾车无共辙，同派有殊澜。\n去去怀知己，何由报一餐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑愔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05348.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05348","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}